  "prefLabel": "Per 102.23 Collective bargaining agreement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.23 “Collective bargaining agreement” means an agreement authorized by RSA 273-A:9 between the state and one or more bargaining units.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.18); renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.20), eff 12-1-25",
